# Tesseract language models are ~4-23 MB binaries. The fast English model is
# committed here so the project builds and runs out of the box; swap in the
# full tessdata_best model locally if you want maximum accuracy and do not want
# it in version control.
# app/src/main/assets/tessdata/*.traineddata

